{"id":"wb-7-874","name":"罗睺寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"罗睺寺","text":"罗睺寺，原名落佛寺，位于山西省忻州市五台山风景名胜区台怀镇杨林村，显通寺和十方堂之间，显通寺和塔院寺东侧一路之隔，藏传佛教寺庙，兼有汉传佛教和藏传佛教的风格。与显通寺、塔院寺、殊像寺、菩萨顶合称五台山五大禅处。已列为全国重点文物保护单位、汉族地区佛教全国重点寺院之一。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BD%97%E7%9D%BA%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":93284119,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93284119","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核百科重定向、文物名称与同一地点；引用版本已锁定","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/84e68aa68439dd02e6c8b01c.jpg","title":"Luohou_Temple_17_2011-07.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Luohou_Temple_17_2011-07.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/Luohou_Temple_17_2011-07.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​五台山罗睺寺，大雄宝殿之侧面。","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图"}}